>> title: Sausage and Peppers
>> category: Stews & Braises
>> tags: sausage, peppers, onions, italian, one-pot, skillet
>> counters: One Pot
>> aka: sausage and peppers and onions, Italian sausage and peppers, sausage peppers onions, feast sausage
>> servings: 4
>> time: 50 min
>> step.1: Sausages brown alone and come out. The peppers go soft in their fat, then the sausages come back under a lid.
>> step.2: brown 10 min, out to a plate
>> step.3: soften 12 min in the fat
>> step.4: deglaze, 2 min
>> step.5: braise covered 15 min, sausages back
>> step.6: On a torn roll with the pan juices spooned over, and what is left folded into eggs the next day.

Not all at once: the sausages brown alone and come out, the peppers go soft in the fat they left, and the sausages come back to finish under a lid.

Brown @sweet Italian sausages{6}(about 1 1/2 lb / 700 g) in @olive oil{1%Tbs} in a #large skillet{} for ~brown{10%min}, turned.

Soften @bell peppers{3%large}(one red, one yellow, one green; sliced in strips), @yellow onions{2%medium}(sliced), @garlic{4%cloves}(sliced) for ~saute{12%min}.

Deglaze @&(~1)peppers{} with @dry white wine{1/2%cup}(120 mL), @dried oregano{1%tsp} for ~simmer{2%min}.

Braise @&(~3)browned sausages{} covered in @&(~1)peppers{} with @kosher salt{1%tsp}, @red wine vinegar{2%tsp} for ~braise{15%min}.

This is a filling before it is a dinner.
